Dear Craig Jacobs,

Greetings from CloudDesk Mail. I am Anele Dlamini and I am pleased to share our edition November 2026 with you and the team at Bay Dental Rooms.

Product news this month is a refreshed inbox view that groups patient bookings, supplier notes and staff rosters so your front desk can find messages faster. We have also added simple search filters and a tidy archive folder for last season files.

Seasonal tip as we head into summer is to set up an out of office template for December leave and to clear large attachments from sent items to keep mailboxes light.

Thank you for reading. If you no longer wish to receive this newsletter, please reply with unsubscribe in your message and we will remove you.

